        "custom_liquid_WpKrcL": {
          "type": "custom-liquid",
          "name": "img/text 1",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{% comment %}\n  Seção imagem + texto para Custom Liquid no Shopify Horizon.\n  Antes de usar: envie o arquivo sculpting-story-photo.png em Conteúdo > Arquivos.\n  Caso renomeie a imagem, atualize o nome dentro de file_url abaixo.\n{% endcomment %}\n\n<section class=\"vr-story-sculpt-left\" aria-labelledby=\"vr-story-sculpt-left-title\">\n  <div class=\"vr-story-sculpt-left__image\">\n    <img\n      src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0791/0994/7505/files/ls-lacetights-ic1-gonna.webp?v=1793653820\"\n      alt=\"Woman wearing a beige top and black sculpting shorts, holding a cup beside a sofa\"\n      width=\"519\"\n      height=\"650\"\n      loading=\"lazy\"\n    >\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"vr-story-sculpt-left__text\">\n    <h2 id=\"vr-story-sculpt-left-title\">The woman who loves the outfit and hates the layers.</h2>\n\n    <p>You have the skirt. You have the boots. What you do not have is the patience for shapewear, then tights, then a dress that catches on both.\n\nThese are one layer. The waist does the holding, the lace does the showing.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .vr-story-sculpt-left,\n  .vr-story-sculpt-left * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .vr-story-sculpt-left {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);\n    align-items: stretch;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 1040px;\n    min-height: 650px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid #e9e9e9;\n    border-radius: 15px;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #171717;\n    font-family: inherit;\n  }\n\n  .vr-story-sculpt-left__image {\n    width: 100%;\n    min-width: 0;\n    min-height: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .vr-story-sculpt-left__image img {\n    display: block;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    min-height: 650px;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    object-position: center center;\n  }\n\n  .vr-story-sculpt-left__text {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    min-width: 0;\n    padding: 48px 40px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\n  .vr-story-sculpt-left__text h2 {\n    margin: 0 0 20px;\n    color: #584c43;\n    font-family: inherit !important;\n    font-size: clamp(26px, 2.65vw, 30px);\n    font-style: normal;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n    text-transform: none;\n  }\n\n  .vr-story-sculpt-left__text p {\n    margin: 0 0 12px;\n    color: #171717;\n    font-family: inherit !important;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.54;\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n    text-transform: none;\n  }\n\n  .vr-story-sculpt-left__text p:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* Desktop: amplia a secao mesmo dentro de um bloco central estreito do Horizon. */\n  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {\n    .vr-story-sculpt-left {\n      position: relative;\n      left: 50%;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      width: min(1320px, calc(100vw - 56px));\n      max-width: none;\n      min-height: 740px;\n      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 47fr) minmax(0, 53fr);\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n\n    .vr-story-sculpt-left__image img {\n      min-height: 740px;\n    }\n\n    .vr-story-sculpt-left__text {\n      padding: 60px clamp(44px, 5vw, 86px);\n    }\n\n    .vr-story-sculpt-left__text h2 {\n      font-size: clamp(32px, 2.7vw, 38px);\n    }\n\n    .vr-story-sculpt-left__text p {\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 749px) {\n    .vr-story-sculpt-left {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      min-height: 0;\n      border-radius: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .vr-story-sculpt-left__image {\n      aspect-ratio: 519 / 650;\n    }\n\n    .vr-story-sculpt-left__image img {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      min-height: 0;\n    }\n\n    .vr-story-sculpt-left__text {\n      padding: 28px 24px 32px;\n    }\n\n    .vr-story-sculpt-left__text h2 {\n      margin-bottom: 18px;\n      font-size: clamp(24px, 6vw, 29px);\n      line-height: 1.23;\n    }\n\n    .vr-story-sculpt-left__text p {\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 1.55;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>"
