        "custom_liquid_Tgzmyi": {
          "type": "custom-liquid",
          "name": "FAQ",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"vr-faq-section\">\n\n  <div class=\"vr-faq-header\">\n    <span class=\"vr-faq-label\">FAQs</span>\n\n    <h2>HAVE QUESTIONS? WE'RE HERE TO HELP!</h2>\n\n    <p>\n      Need help? Write to us at\n      <a href=\"mailto:info@nichsape.com\">\n        info@nicshape.com\n      </a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"vr-faq-list\">\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Does it roll down?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        No. There are built in bones that stop the band from folding over, and anti slip silicone strips on the inside that grip your skin. It is the part we would not cut.\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Will it push my back fat over the top?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        This is why the waist is high and the band is wide. A narrow band digs in and creates a line. A wide, boned band spreads the hold, so nothing spills over the edge.\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Will I be too hot in it?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        The knit is breathable and moisture wicking, and it is light. It works in summer too. It is a layer, not a wetsuit.\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Can I breathe and eat in it?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        Yes. It is high control, which means firm, not punishing. If you feel squeezed, you are in the wrong size. Go up one.\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Does it add padding?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        No. The lift comes from 3D tailoring in the back panels. It shapes what is already yours.\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>What size should I get?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        Measure your waist and hips and use the chart.\n\nEU 32-34: waist 60-66 cm, hips 86-100\nEU 36-38: waist 67-82, hips 101-113\nEU 40-42: waist 83-99, hips 114-127\nEU 44-46: waist 100-114, hips 128-137\nEU 48-50: waist 115-127, hips 138-147\n\nBetween two sizes, go up. If waist and hips land in different sizes, follow your hips. Still unsure, message us with your measurements and we will tell you.\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>How do I wash it?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        Hand wash cold, do not bleach, line dry, do not iron. The silicone and the bones last longer that way.\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>When will my order arrive?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        SHIPPING TIMES:\n\nArrives in 5-7 days\n\nWHAT YOU RECEIVE:\n\n📦 Tracking number to follow the package\n📞 Assistance always available if you have questions\n\nWARNING: We are in winter season. The most requested sizes sell out quickly!\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n    <details class=\"vr-faq-item\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Can I wear it every day?</span>\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"vr-faq-answer\">\n        That is what it is for.\n      </div>\n    </details>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .vr-faq-section {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 35px 30px 45px;\n    color: #111;\n    font-family: inherit;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-section *,\n  .vr-faq-section *::before,\n  .vr-faq-section *::after {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  /* CABEÇALHO */\n\n  .vr-faq-header {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 32px;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-label {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-header h2 {\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.6vw, 40px);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    letter-spacing: -0.025em;\n    color: #000;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-header p {\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-header a {\n    color: #333;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-underline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n\n  /* LISTA DE PERGUNTAS */\n\n  .vr-faq-list {\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item {\n    display: block;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    border: 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n    background: transparent;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item:first-child {\n    border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 20px;\n    width: 100%;\n    min-height: 57px;\n    padding: 16px 5px;\n    margin: 0;\n    background: transparent;\n    color: #383838;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    text-align: left;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    list-style: none;\n    text-transform: none;\n    letter-spacing: normal;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary::marker {\n    content: '';\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary::before,\n  .vr-faq-item summary::after {\n    content: none !important;\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary:focus-visible {\n    outline: 2px solid currentColor;\n    outline-offset: -2px;\n  }\n\n  /* SETAS */\n\n  .vr-faq-item summary svg {\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    fill: none;\n    stroke: currentColor;\n    stroke-width: 1.5;\n    stroke-linecap: round;\n    stroke-linejoin: round;\n    transition: transform .2s ease;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-item[open] summary svg {\n    transform: rotate(180deg);\n  }\n\n  /* RESPOSTAS */\n\n  .vr-faq-answer {\n    padding: 0 5px 22px;\n    color: #333;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    text-align: left;\n    overflow-wrap: break-word;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-answer p {\n    margin: 0 0 12px;\n  }\n\n  .vr-faq-answer p:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* MOBILE */\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n    .vr-faq-section {\n      padding: 30px 15px 40px;\n    }\n\n    .vr-faq-header {\n      margin-bottom: 28px;\n    }\n\n    .vr-faq-header h2 {\n      font-size: 27px;\n      line-height: 1.2;\n    }\n\n    .vr-faq-header p {\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .vr-faq-item summary {\n      min-height: 57px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      padding: 16px 4px;\n    }\n\n    .vr-faq-answer {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      padding: 0 4px 20px;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .vr-faq-item summary svg {\n      transition: none;\n    }\n  }\n</style>"
